<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Detect Invisible</h1>
<p>Sphere: Detection Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Conjurer (guild level 10), Sorcerer (guild level 11), Assassin (guild level 15)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast detect invisible &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast detect invisible</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>For a while after this spell, the target can see invisible people, creatures 
and things. Wherever something invisible is listed, it shows a (clear) aura. 
It doesn't find those who are hiding: that is another matter (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Hide</a>).
</p><p>The better your detection sphere, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to 
several minutes. You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on 
potions and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Invisibility</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Magic</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>